    "https://www.elon.edu/u/fa/hr/careers": {
      "title": "Careers",
      "description": "Careers | Human Resources | Elon University Jump to main content Jump to search Jump to search Jump to the footer Search Elon.edu Submit Search Elon Main Menu Search Elon.edu Submit Search Give Apply About Admissions Academics Global Campus Life Athletics Alumni Students Faculty & Staff Parents OnTrack Canvas Calendar News Library Maps Directory Email Close Elon.edu Main Navigation Human Resources home Contact Us Human Resources home Menu Working at Elon Build a career at a university where purpose and community drive everything we do. Working at Elon Home Community and Culture Immigration Services Open Positions Internal Job Board Benefits & Wellness Discover the comprehensive benefits package available to you as an Elon University employee. Benefits & Wellness Home Health and Medical Coverage Retirement Faculty/Staff Health & Wellness Clinic Advantages of Working at Elon Seasonal Flexible Scheduling Tuition Remission and Exchange Public Service Loan Forgiveness Holidays and Leave Acorn Academy at Elon University (Child Care) Perks and Resources Life Status Changes Employee Assistance Program Elon Benefits Hub Professional Development Discover opportunities to grow and flourish as an individual and an employee. Professional Development Home Office of Leadership & Professional Development Early & Mid-Career Programs Navigate Your Career Employee Resources Access the forms, policies, and resources that help you navigate your work and stay connected to the Elon community. Employee Resources Home Forms Faculty Handbook University Policies Staff Manual Queens Transition to Elon PageUp Personnel Management and Background Checks Leave Requests and Approvals Accessibility Lactation Spaces on Campus Title IX Coordinator Staff Ombudsperson Campus Safety & Police Continuity of Work New Hires Exiting Elon Home Finance & Administration Human Resources Working at Elon Careers Careers Careers at Elon Your career at Elon University is an opportunity to work within one of America’s best and most innovative universities and communities. Every faculty and staff member at Elon plays a critical role in our collective mission to prepare our students to be creative, resilient, ambitious and ethical citizens of our global culture. As an Elon employee, you’ll work alongside dedicated, caring and supportive colleagues who are invested in the success of each other and our campus and local communities. Elon employees are encouraged to seek career advancement and personal growth using the university’s many professional development opportunities , employee resource groups and career training seminars . In addition to a generous package of advantages that includes excellent health, dental and vision insurance, Elon faculty and staff enjoy tuition remission for themselves and their family members, paid holidays and personal days, and a retirement plan with an 8 percent employer contribution. Skip Nav Working at Elon Community and Culture Advantages of Working at Elon Immigration Services Elon’s Visa Sponsorship Policy Obtaining Your Green Card (PERM) Open Positions Internal Job Board Our Values We affirm that Elon University values and celebrates the diverse backgrounds, cultures, experiences, and perspectives of our community members. We are an Equal Opportunity Employer and will consider all qualified applicants without regard to race, sex, color, ethnicity, or national origin, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, age, disability, genetic information, or veteran status. Additionally, our values include fostering respect for human differences, a passion for lifelong learning, demonstrated personal integrity, and a strong work ethic and sense of service. The perspectives of our employees contribute significantly to our success, and inclusion is a shared responsibility. To learn more, please explore our career opportunities for faculty or staff , as well as information about benefits and our location . Apply for Open Positions Apply for Faculty Positions Apply for Staff Positions Internal Job Board $ Tuition remission and exchange program 8% Employer retirement contribution 15 Vacation and personal days 13 Paid university holidays E-verify Participation Notification Federal law requires all employers to verify the identity and employment eligibility of all persons hired to work in the United States.  Information is provided below and is available to print. Notice of E-Verify Participation – English Este Empleador Participa en E-Verify – Español Right to Work – English Derecho al Trabajo – Español Jump to Top Elon University Facebook Elon University X (formerly Twitter) Elon University Instagram Elon University LinkedIn Elon University Flickr Elon University YouTube Elon University Full Social Media List Contact Elon Emergency Info Campus Directories Visit Campus Online Services EthicsPoint Human Resources Health Status & Alerts Space Reservations Library Bookstore Box Office Privacy Policy Nondiscrimination GDPR Information Accessibility 100 Campus Drive | Elon, NC 27244 336.278.2000 © 2026 Elon University | All Rights Reserved /u/"
    },
