istant - Exercise Science, Neuroscience, and Clinical Mental Health Counseling University Administration Elon College, the College of Arts and Sciences Staff Full-Time Program Assistant, School of Communications University Administration School of Communications Staff Full-Time Principal Faculty Member Department of Physician Assistant Studies Elon Academic Affairs School of Health Sciences Faculty Full-Time Clinical Instructional (Preceptor) - Physician Assistant Studies Academic Affairs School of Health Sciences Temporary Adjunct Instructor, Sport Management Department Academic Affairs School of Communications Adjunct Project Manager, Integration University Administration University Operations President's Office Staff Full-Time Community Director for Oaks Neighborhood Student Services Residence Life Staff Full-Time Assistant Director of Internships Student Services Love School of Business Staff Full-Time Director of Academic Communications and School of Education Marketing Communication & Marketing Academic Communications Staff Full-Time Moving and Set-up Worker Facilities Facilities Management Staff Full-Time Program Assistant- Departments of Computer Science, Engineering & Physics University Administration Staff Full-Time Aquatics Coordinator Student Services University Operations Staff Full-Time Financial Aid Customer Service Specialist Finance Financial Aid Staff Full-Time Fleet Mechanic II Facilities Facilities Management Staff Full-Time Painter Facilities Facilities Management Staff Full-Time Associate Vice President for Student Professional Development Advancement Services Staff Full-Time Assistant Women's Lacrosse Coach Athletics Staff Full-Time Botanical Garden Coordinator Facilities Facilities Management Staff Full-Time Department of Physical Therapy Education Faculty Member Academic Affairs School of Health Sciences Faculty Full-Time Head Men's Tennis Coach Athletics Staff Full-Time Gardener Facilities Facilities Management Staff Full-Time Broadcast Engineer Information Technology Information Technology Staff Full-Time HVACR Mechanic II Facilities Facilities Management Staff Full-Time Program Assistant for the Department of Physician Assistant Studies - Elon Health Services University Administration School of Health Sciences Staff Full-Time Assistant Men's Tennis Coach Athletics Staff Part-Time Director of Live Broadcast Production for Athletics Athletics Staff Full-Time Slattery Center Operations Manager Student Services Staff Full-Time Displaying 1 - 30 of 48 in total ‹ 1 2 › Non-Discrimination Statement Elon University does not discriminate on the basis of race, color, or national origin (including shared ancestry or ethnic characteristics), sex (including sexual orientation, gender identity, and pregnancy or related conditions), age, disability, genetic information, religion, veteran’s status, or any other protected basis under applicable law (collectively, “Protected Categories”) in the recruitment and admission of students, the recruitment and employment of faculty and staff, or the operation of any of its programs and activities. Quick Links Title IX Privacy Policy Emergency Information Our Culture and Diversity Copyright © 2026 All Rights Reserved by Elon University . Facebook Twitter Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Elon Social Media Page Candidate Details × This website uses cookies. We use cookies to personalize content such as job recommendations, and to analyze our traffic. You consent to our cookies if you click \"I Accept\". If you click on \"I Do Not Accept\", then we will not use cookies but you may have a deteriorated user experience. You can change your settings by clicking on the Settings link on the top right of the device. I do not accept I accept"
