      "title": "Job Description for the Program Assistant",
      "description": "Program Assistant - Exercise Science, Neuroscience, and Clinical Mental Health Counseling - Elon Campus, North Carolina, United States About Benefits Human Resources Working at Elon View Jobs Applicant Login Kiosk mode Job Description for the Program Assistant - Exercise Science, Neuroscience, and Clinical Mental Health Counseling position. Review job description, requirements, and qualifications. Apply or register interest for the position. Program Assistant - Exercise Science, Neuroscience, and Clinical Mental Health Counseling Elon Campus, North Carolina, 27244 University Administration Staff Full-Time Add to favorites View favorites Title: Program Assistant - Exercise Science, Neuroscience, and Clinical Mental Health Counseling Position Type: Staff Full-Time Days Per Week: M-F Hours Per Week: 40 VP Area: Office of the Provost and Academic Affairs Department: Elon College, the College of Arts and Sciences Location: Elon Main Campus Position Summary Position involves the performance of a variety of administrative, clerical, and office management duties. Position requires knowledge of College and University policies and procedures to communicate information involving academic programs, functions, and services. Duties performed include using office technology to compile presentations, records, and reports; organizing, maintaining, and distributing information from the office to other units on campus; and greeting/referring/assisting visitors/faculty/staff/others. Completion of work often involves serving as office representative in obtaining, clarifying, and providing information about programs in the College. Position serves as the primary staff assistant to the Chair(s), Program Directors, Dean(s) and faculty in the department(s) and the College. Benefits of Working at Elon As an Elon University employee, you’ll join an internationally acclaimed university with a commitment to fostering a thriving community. Ranked among the most innovative, 